1680 0 obj
  << /ActualText (God Cares Ministries is a self\055supporting\054 volunteer\055led humanitarian and spiritual ministry established in 1999\056 Our work is founded on \034The Universal Royal Law of Love\035\054 which calls humanity to live by truth\054 compassion\054 and moral responsibility\056 Since our beginning\054 we have been a group of committed volunteers who willingly share our time\054 talents\054 and resources to reach out to the needy in all possible ways\056 We believe that true service goes beyond charity\024it restores dignity\054 awakens conscience\054 and strengthens communities\056)
     /K [ 15 ]
     /P 1681 0 R
     /Pg 1650 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

