1696 0 obj
  << /ActualText (We envision a world where love replaces indifference\054 compassion overcomes injustice\054 and every Individual is treated with dignity and respect\056 Our vision is to see transformed lives\054 restored communities\054 and a renewed moral consciousness where service is guided by humility\054 integrity\054 and love\054 inspiring people to build a society rooted in peace\054 unity\054 responsibility\054 and genuine care for humanity\056)
     /K [ 23 ]
