1700 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The mission of God Cares Ministries is to serve humanity through love in action\056 Rooted in The Universal Royal Law of Love\054 we strive to bring hope\054 healing\054 and dignity to individuals and communities in need\056 We are committed to meeting physical\054 emotional\054 and spiritual needs through compassion\054 service\054 and moral responsibility\054 inspiring people to live with Integrity\054 kindness\054 and care for one another\056)
     /K [ 25 ]
     /P 1701 0 R
